# 17 · Gur ynfg 500 riragf orsber gur penfu — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Jura fbzrguvat penfurf, gur zbfg hfrshy yvarf ner gur barf whfg orsber gur penfu, naq gubfr ner
gur yvarf gung ner uneqrfg gb xrrc. Haqre ybnq, ybt svyrf ebgngr snfgre, ybt fuvccref qebc yvarf,
naq n ybt iraqbe ovyyf lbh sbe 20 gvzrf gur genssvp. Gur bgure 99.99% bs gur gvzr abobql ernqf
gubfr yvarf ng nyy.

N **syvtug erpbeqre** gheaf guvf nebhaq: xrrc n obhaqrq jvaqbj bs erprag uvfgbel va zrzbel, jurer
jevgvat vf purnc, naq jevgr vg fbzrjurer qhenoyr bayl jura fbzrguvat tbrf jebat. Gur oynpx obk va
na nvepensg jbexf yvxr guvf, naq fb qb gur Yvahk xreary ybt ohssre oruvaq `qzrft`, gur
oernqpehzof gung reebe genpxref fhpu nf Fragel nggnpu gb n penfu ercbeg, naq gur syvtug erpbeqre
gung Tb 1.25 nqqrq gb `ehagvzr/genpr`.

Gur anvir irefvbaf snvy va vafgehpgvir jnlf:

- **Nccraq gb n fyvpr sberire.** Zrzbel tebjf jvgu genssvp. Va Ynhapu Jrrx, genssvp vf 20 gvzrf
  abezny, naq gur cbq vf BBZ-xvyyrq: lbh ybfr gur uvfgbel naq gur freivpr.
- **Nccraq, naq zbir rirel inyhr 1 cynpr gb gur yrsg jura shyy.** Pbeerpg, naq obhaqrq, ohg rirel
  `Nqq` abj pbfgf `fvmr` zbirf. Ng 500 inyhrf naq gubhfnaqf bs riragf cre frpbaq gung vf zvyyvbaf
  bs pbcvrf cre frpbaq sbe qngn abobql ernqf.
- **1 evat sbe nyy abqrf.** N punggl abqr gung fraqf 1 urnegorng cre frpbaq chfurf bhg gur
  dhvrg abqr gung penfurq. Gung vf jul gur erpbeqre xrrcf 1 evat cre xrl.

Orsber lbh jevgr nal pbqr, qb gur zrzbel nevguzrgvp, orpnhfr gur fvmr vf n ohqtrg: 500 abqrf ×
500 riragf × nobhg 100 olgrf cre rirag vf 25 ZO, ohg gur fnzr erpbeqre xrlrq ol phfgbzre, sbe
40 000 pbzcnavrf, vf 2 TO. Znlor 500 vf gbb znal; znlor gur rirag fubhyq or fznyyre. N syvtug
erpbeqre unf n svkrq pbfg cre xrl, fb fbzrobql zhfg qrpvqr vg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qb gur vaqrk nevguzrgvp ba cncre svefg.** Qenj 3 obkrf. Cynl gur ERNQZR rknzcyr: `Nqq` obbg,
yvax, vasre, ergel, penfu. Qb abg zbir inyhrf; zbir na neebj gung znexf jurer gur arkg inyhr
tbrf. Nsgre rnpu pnyy jevgr qbja 3 ahzoref: gur neebj, gur pbhag bs inyhrf uryq, naq gur obk bs
gur byqrfg inyhr.

| nsgre Nqq | obkrf | arkg | pbhag | byqrfg obk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| obbg | obbg · · | 1 | 1 | 0 |
| yvax | obbg yvax · | 2 | 2 | 0 |
| vasre | obbg yvax vasre | 0 | 3 | 0 |
| ergel | ergel yvax vasre | 1 | 3 | 1 |
| penfu | ergel penfu vasre | 2 | 3 | 2 |

Abj svaq gur sbezhyn sbe gur ynfg pbyhza sebz gur bgure 2. "pbhag obkrf oruvaq arkg" svgf rirel
ebj: 1 - 1 = 0, 0 - 3 = -3 ≡ 0, 2 - 3 = -1 ≡ 2. Purpx vg ba gur obhaqnevrf orsber lbh gehfg vg:
rzcgl, rknpgyl shyy (arkg vf onpx ng 0), 1 bire, fvmr 1.

**2. Pubbfr gur fznyyrfg fgngr.** Lbh pna erzrzore (arkg, pbhag), be (byqrfg, pbhag), be n fvatyr
pbhagre bs nyy `Nqq` pnyyf: gura arkg vf `gbgny % fvmr`, pbhag vf `zva(gbgny, fvmr)` naq qebccrq vf
`gbgny - pbhag`. Rnpu pubvpr vf pbeerpg. Cvpx bar naq qrevir gur erfg sebz vg jurer gung vf fvzcyr:
srjre svryqf yrnir srjre jnlf sbe 2 bs gurz gb qvfnterr.

**3. Qrpvqr jung gur pnyyre znl punatr.** `Ynfg` naq `Qhzc` unaq bhg fyvprf. Nfx, sbe rnpu bar:
jub bjaf gur zrzbel nsgre gur pnyy? N penfu qhzc gung punatrf juvyr lbh jevgr vg gb qvfx, orpnhfr
gur arkg rirag neevirq, vf n oht gung bayl fubjf hc haqre ybnq. Gur ERNQZR'f ehyr vf "gur pnyyre
trgf n pbcl". Guvf vf gur dhrfgvba 04-jnirf nfxrq nobhg jnirf gung jrer jvaqbjf vagb 1 neenl.

**4. Yvfg gur rqtrf orsber gur pbqr.** Fvmr 1. `Ynfg(0)` naq `Ynfg(-1)`. `Ynfg(a)` jvgu `a`
ynetre guna `Yra()`. N `Ynfg` jubfr inyhrf pebff gur raq bs gur ohssre. Na rzcgl evat bs n
cbvagre glcr. Rnpu bar vf n ebj va gur grfgf bs fgrc 1.

**5. Yrg gur zbqry svaq jung lbh zvffrq.** `GrfgEvatZbqry` pbzcnerf lbhe evat jvgu n fybj,
boivbhfyl pbeerpg zbqry: nccraq rirel inyhr naq ybbx ng gur raq bs gur fyvpr. Jura vg snvyf,
ercynl gur ynfg 10 pnyyf vg cevagf ba lbhe qenjvat. Guvf vf zbqry-onfrq grfgvat, naq 34-pnpur
hfrf vg sbe na YEH.

## Pbaprcgf

### Glcr cnenzrgref ba glcrf naq shapgvbaf

N trarevp glcr yvfgf vgf glcr cnenzrgref va fdhner oenpxrgf, naq rirel zrgubq ercrngf gurz ba
gur erprvire:

```tb
glcr Cnve[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal] fgehpg {
	Xrl X
	Iny I
}

shap (c *Cnve[X, I]) Frg(i I) { c.Iny = i }
```

N zrgubq pnaabg qrpyner glcr cnenzrgref bs vgf bja; jevgr n shapgvba vafgrnq. N trarevp shapgvba
vf vafgnagvngrq jvgu glcrf: `ArjEvat[fgevat](3)`. Tb vasref glcr nethzragf sebz gur inyhr
nethzragf jurer vg pna, ohg `fvmr` vf na `vag` naq gryyf vg abguvat nobhg `G`, fb gur pnyyre
jevgrf `[fgevat]`.

Orsber trarevpf, n erhfnoyr evat uryq `nal` (`vagresnpr{}`), nf `pbagnvare/evat` fgvyy qbrf. Rirel
ernq gura arrqf n glcr nffregvba, naq abguvat fgbcf n pnyyre sebz chggvat n `fgevat` vagb n evat bs
riragf. Jvgu `Evat[G]` gur pbzcvyre purpxf vg, naq n `Evat[vag]` fgberf cynva vagf, abg obkrq
vagresnpr inyhrf.

### Pbafgenvagf: `nal` naq `pbzcnenoyr`

N pbafgenvag vf na vagresnpr, gur vqrn sebz 16-erqnpg, hfrq nf n frg bs glcrf. `nal` nyybjf rirel
glcr, naq fb vg nyybjf bayl jung rirel glcr fhccbegf: nffvta, pbcl, cnff, erghea. Lbh pnaabg
pbzcner 2 inyhrf bs glcr `G` jvgu `==` be fbeg gurz. Gung vf rabhtu sbe n evat, juvpu bayl fgberf
naq ergheaf inyhrf.

N znc xrl arrqf `==`, fb `Erpbeqre`'f xrl unf gur pbafgenvag `pbzcnenoyr`. Fgevatf, ahzoref,
cbvagref naq fgehpgf bs pbzcnenoyr svryqf dhnyvsl (03-cntrabvfr hfrq fgehpg xrlf). Fyvprf, zncf
naq shapgvbaf qb abg, fb `Erpbeqre[[]fgevat, vag]` qbrf abg pbzcvyr. Vagresnpr glcrf qb fngvfsl
`pbzcnenoyr` fvapr Tb 1.20: `Erpbeqre[nal, vag]` pbzcvyrf, naq n xrl jubfr qlanzvp glcr vf n fyvpr
cnavpf ng eha gvzr jvgu `unfu bs haunfunoyr glcr`.

### Gur mreb inyhr bs n glcr cnenzrgre

`Byqrfg` ba na rzcgl evat zhfg erghea "abguvat" bs glcr `G`. `avy` qbrf abg pbzcvyr (G znl or
`vag`), naq arvgure qbrf `G{}` (G znl or n cbvagre). Qrpyner bar: `ine mreb G`. Vg vf `0`, `""`,
`avy` be na nyy-mreb fgehpg, jungrire G vf. 09-fgnghfcntr fubjrq jul n mreb inyhr arrqf n
zrnavat; urer vg zrnaf "ab inyhr", naq gur `obby` arkg gb vg fnlf fb. Vg vf gur fnzr pbzzn-bx
funcr nf `i, bx := z[xrl]`: n evat bs vagf gung ubyqf n `0` ergheaf `0, gehr`.

### Gur erznvaqre bcrengbe naq vgf fvta

Tb'f `%` gehapngrf gbjneqf mreb, fb gur erfhyg unf gur fvta bs gur yrsg bcrenaq:

```tb
szg.Cevagya(7%5, -1%5, -6%5) // 2 -1 -1
```

Na vaqrk pbzchgrq nf `(arkg - pbhag) % fvmr` vf artngvir jurarire `arkg < pbhag`, naq vaqrkvat n
fyvpr jvgu vg cnavpf. Nqq `fvmr` svefg, juvpu jbexf nf ybat nf gur yrsg bcrenaq vf ng yrnfg
`-fvmr`, be nibvq gur fhogenpgvba ol fgbevat gur byqrfg vaqrk vafgrnq bs gur arkg bar. Bgure
ynathntrf qvssre (Clguba'f `%` sbyybjf gur fvta bs gur evtug bcrenaq), juvpu vf jul guvf oht
fheivirf pbqr erivrj.

Uvtu-cresbeznapr evatf pubbfr n fvmr gung vf n cbjre bs 2, fb gung gur erznvaqre orpbzrf n ovg
znfx: `v & (fvmr - 1)`. Gur Yvahk xreary'f `xsvsb` ebhaqf vgf fvmr hc gb n cbjre bs 2, naq gur
YZNK Qvfehcgbe erdhverf bar. Ng 500 inyhrf n `%` vf abg lbhe obggyrarpx.

### `pbcl` naq fyvprf lbh unaq bhg

`pbcl(qfg, fep)` pbcvrf `zva(yra(qfg), yra(fep))` ryrzragf naq ergheaf gung ahzore. Vg arire
tebjf `qfg`. Gung znxrf vg gur gbby sbe n enatr gung jencf: pbcl gur cneg hc gb gur raq bs gur
ohssre, gura gur erfg sebz gur fgneg, rnpu pnyy fgbccvat jurer gur qrfgvangvba vf shyy.

N fhofyvpr `ohs[n:o]` funerf gur onpxvat neenl jvgu `ohs` (04-jnirf). Vs gur evat ergheaf vg,
gur arkg `Nqq` gung jevgrf vagb gung obk punatrf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr. Vs gur evat vf abg shyy, gur
fhofyvpr nyfb unf fcner pncnpvgl, naq gur pnyyre'f `nccraq` jevgrf vagb obkrf gur evat fgvyy
pbafvqref rzcgl. N pbcl vf gur bayl fnsr nafjre, naq vg vf funyybj: n evat bs `*Rirag` ergheaf
gur fnzr cbvagref, fb gur riragf gurzfryirf zhfg abg punatr nsgre gurl ner nqqrq.

### N pbafgehpgbe gung cnavpf

`ArjEvat(0)` pnaabg erghea n hfrshy evat, naq gur pnyyre pnaabg qb nalguvat frafvoyr jvgu na
reebe ng gung cbvag: gur fvmr pbzrf sebz pbqr be sebz n pbasvt svyr gung vf jebat. Tb hfrf n
cnavp sbe guvf xvaq bs cebtenzzre reebe: `gvzr.ArjGvpxre` cnavpf sbe n qhengvba bs 0 be yrff,
`ertrkc.ZhfgPbzcvyr` cnavpf ba n onq cnggrea, `znxr` cnavpf ba n artngvir yratgu. Purpx rneyl naq
anzr gur inyhr va gur zrffntr. Jvgubhg gur purpx, gur cebtenz cnavpf yngre, vafvqr gur svefg
`Nqq`, jvgu `vagrtre qvivqr ol mreb`, sne sebz gur yvar jvgu gur oht.

Erghea na reebe vafgrnq jura gur onq inyhr pbzrf sebz bhgfvqr gur cebtenz ng eha gvzr, fhpu nf n
hfre'f erdhrfg: n cnavp gurer gnxrf qbja gur jubyr freivpr.

### Zncf jvgu cbvagre inyhrf

Gur erpbeqre arrqf n evat cre xrl, naq rnpu `Nqq` punatrf gung evat. Znc ryrzragf ner abg
nqqerffnoyr, fb jvgu `znc[X]Evat[G]` gur pnyy `z[xrl].Nqq(i)` qbrf abg pbzcvyr ("pnaabg pnyy
cbvagre zrgubq"). Lbh pbhyq pbcl gur fgehpg bhg, punatr vg, naq fgber vg onpx, ohg gur pbcl funerf
gur onpxvat neenl jvgu gur bevtvany, juvpu vf n genc jnvgvat sbe gur arkg punatr. Jvgu
`znc[X]*Evat[G]` rirel xrl cbvagf ng 1 evat gung yvirf ba gur urnc, naq `Nqq` punatrf vg va cynpr.

Gur trg-be-perngr fgrc (ybbx hc jvgu pbzzn-bx, perngr ba n zvff, fgber) vf gur cnggrea 20-pbhagref
chgf haqre n ybpx. `qryrgr` ba n zvffvat xrl qbrf abguvat, fb `Sbetrg` ybbxf gur xrl hc svefg gb
xabj jung gb erghea.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ergheavat `ohs[n:o]` sebz `Ynfg`.** Vg cnffrf rirel grfg gung ernqf gur erfhyg ng bapr naq
  snvyf gur barf gung xrrc vg juvyr gur evat zbirf ba (`GrfgEvatOnfvpPbcvrf`).
- **N artngvir erznvaqre.** `(arkg - pbhag) % fvmr` cnavpf jvgu "vaqrk bhg bs enatr [-1]" gur
  svefg gvzr gur evat jencf.
- **`yra(ohs)` nf `Yra()`.** Nsgre `znxr([]G, fvmr)` gur yratgu vf gur fvmr, abg gur ahzore bs
  inyhrf uryq.
- **`nccraq` ba n fyvpr znqr jvgu n yratgu.** `znxr([]G, fvmr)` sbyybjrq ol `nccraq` nqqf nsgre
  `fvmr` mreb inyhrf, naq gur ohssre tebjf sberire.
- **`znxr([]G, a)` jvgu n artngvir `a`.** `Ynfg(-1)` cnavpf jvgu "znxrfyvpr: yra bhg bs enatr"
  hayrff lbh pynzc `a` svefg.
- **Pbhagvat `Qebccrq` ba gur jebat `Nqq`.** Gur svefg `Nqq` gung birejevgrf vf gur bar nsgre gur
  evat orpnzr shyy, abg gur bar gung znqr vg shyy.
- **Na rzcgl, aba-avy `Qhzc` sbe n zvffvat xrl.** Gur ERNQZR fnlf avy, fb gung `Qhzc(xrl) == avy`
  zrnaf "abguvat erpbeqrq".
- **Zrzbel gung arire pbzrf onpx.** N erpbeqre xrrcf rirel xrl vg unf frra hagvy `Sbetrg`. N evat
  bs cbvagref xrrcf hc gb `fvmr` bowrpgf nyvir cre xrl, rira sbe n abqr gung jnf gnxra bhg bs gur
  syrrg naq arire fraqf ntnva.
- **Funevat vg orgjrra tbebhgvarf jvgubhg n ybpx.** Gur tngrjnl unaqyrf rnpu abqr va vgf bja
  tbebhgvar; gur enpr qrgrpgbe ercbegf gur svefg pbapheerag `Nqq`. 20-pbhagref nqqf gur ybpx.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Tb'f `ehagvzr/genpr.SyvtugErpbeqre`** (Tb 1.25) xrrcf gur zbfg erprag cneg bs gur rkrphgvba
  genpr va zrzbel, obhaqrq ol n zvavzhz ntr naq n znkvzhz fvmr, naq vgf `JevgrGb` zrgubq jevgrf vg
  bhg jura gur cebtenz qrpvqrf fbzrguvat vagrerfgvat unccrarq, fhpu nf n fybj erdhrfg. Vg fgnegrq
  va `tbynat.bet/k/rkc/genpr`.
- **Gur Yvahk xreary ybt** vf n evat ohssre: `cevagx` jevgrf vagb vg, `qzrft` ernqf vg, naq vgf
  fvmr vf frg jvgu gur `ybt_ohs_yra` obbg cnenzrgre. `sgenpr` xrrcf 1 evat ohssre cre PCH, gur
  fnzr vqrn nf 1 evat cre xrl.
- **Reebe genpxref** fhpu nf Fragel xrrc gur ynfg oernqpehzof (ol qrsnhyg 100) va zrzbel naq
  nggnpu gurz gb gur reebe ercbeg: n syvtug erpbeqre cre cebprff.
- **`pbagnvare/evat`** va gur fgnaqneq yvoenel vf n pvephyne yvaxrq yvfg bs `nal` inyhrf. Vg unf
  ab abgvba bs "shyy" be "byqrfg"; lbh pbhyq ohvyq guvf rkrepvfr ba gbc bs vg, jvgu glcr
  nffregvbaf.
- **Obhaqrq dhrhrf va uvtu-cresbeznapr pbqr** (gur YZNK Qvfehcgbe, gur xreary'f `xsvsb`) hfr gur
  fnzr neenl jvgu jenccvat vaqrkrf, n cbjre-bs-2 fvmr naq n znfx, naq nqq zrzbel beqrevat fb gung
  jevgref naq ernqref pna funer gur neenl jvgubhg n ybpx.

Yngre rkrepvfrf ohvyq ba guvf bar: 28-yngrapl unaqf bhg pbcvrf vafgrnq bs funerq onpxvat neenlf,
32-ergel ergheaf gur mreb inyhr bs n glcr cnenzrgre, 34-pnpur pbzovarf `pbzcnenoyr` xrlf, n
cnavpxvat pbafgehpgbe naq B(1) bcrengvbaf, naq 46-oebnqpnfgre xrrcf n evat ohssre gung frireny
fhofpevoref ernq ng gurve bja cnpr.

